                            ClaimTypes = new[] { "K", "I" },
                            Conditions = "Course fees, textbooks, stationery and student fees for study with a sufficient connection to your employment when the cost was incurred: it maintains or improves skills or knowledge your current job requires (claim type K), or is likely to increase income from your current job (I). Not claimable: study while not employed, study only generally related to your job or to get a new job, Commonwealth supported place fees paid upfront or with HECS-HELP, HELP/SFSS/SSL/AASL/VSL repayments, and reimbursed amounts. FEE-HELP and VET Student Loan tuition can qualify. Travel, car and decline-in-value self-education costs are not calculated.",
